muew-preset 2
name Velvet Drone
category Pad
author MUEW Factory
tags drone dark warm soft
desc Dark, soft low drone with a triangle sub. Good for film beds.
osc1Shape 1
osc2Shape 2
osc2Detune -12
osc2Level 0.35
filterCutoff 700
filterReso 0.3
filterMode 0
amp 2 1 1 4
mod 0.01 0.3 0 0.2
lfo1Rate 5
lfo1Shape 0
lfo2 0.35 1
warp1 0 0
warp2 0 0
mseg 1 0 4 0 0 0.15 1 0.55 -0.3 1 0
unison 1 1 0.1 0.1 0.5 0.7
lfo34 0.08 0 2 1
sub 0.45 1 1
noise 0.05 0.2
routes 7
route 9 2 0.6
route 5 2 3
route 6 5 0.7
route 6 6 0.7
route 7 4 4
route 8 1 0.3
route 8 3 0.25
chorus 0 0.6 6 15 0.35
delay 0 0.28 0.42 0.35 0.22
reverb 1 0.92 0.4 0.4
comp 1 0.3
